# Normalise to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Git's autocrlf checked files out as CRLF, which broke two things that read
# their own source as text: scripts/contrast.mjs matches a two-line selector
# in tokens.css and stopped finding it, and a test file failed to parse. Both
# were silent until the tooling ran.
#
# The engine is meant to be reproducible by anyone who clones this. That has
# to include the line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# binary, never touched
*.png binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
